OL,5,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe first host, Mrs Tee, charms
OL,7,     Fher guests with her eccentric
OL,8,     Fways, at the four-star Gorse
OL,9,     FMeadow in the New Forest. But not
OL,10,     Feveryone's room is up to scratch.
OL,11,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FAlistair and Emma host at their
OL,13,     Ffour-star Castle Hill Guesthouse
OL,14,     Fin sleepy Lynton, north Devon. The
OL,15,     Fgroup activity requires a head for
OL,16,     Fheights, and Mrs Tee proves hard
OL,17,     Fto please.
